<task id="Entering_Characters_on_the_LCD_Screen" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Entering Characters on the LCD Screen</title>
   <shortdesc>Follow these guidelines to enter characters for passwords and other settings.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>placeholder</keyword>
        <keyword>select</keyword>
        <keyword>press</keyword>
        <keyword>Entering</keyword>
        <keyword>Characters</keyword>
        <keyword>Screen</keyword>
        <indexterm>placeholder</indexterm>
        <indexterm>select</indexterm>
        <indexterm>press</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <taskbody>  <context>
    <p>Follow these guidelines to enter characters for passwords and other settings.</p><p>
         <fig>
            <title>placeholder</title>
            <image href="../media/image59.jpeg" placement="break" height="199" width="199">
               <alt>placeholder</alt>
            </image>
         </fig>
      </p><ul id="ul_05013206">
         <li>To scroll through the characters, press the arrow buttons.</li>
         <li>To make a selection, press the <b>OK</b>button.</li>
         <li>To change the character case or type, select <b>A1#</b>or press the <image href="../media/image60.png" placement="break" height="13" width="13">
               <alt>placeholder</alt>
            </image> reset button.</li>
         <li>To move the cursor to the left or right, select <image href="../media/image61.png" placement="break" height="17" width="16">
               <alt>placeholder</alt>
            </image> or <image href="../media/image62.png" placement="break" height="17" width="16">
               <alt>placeholder</alt>
            </image> .</li>
         <li>To add a space, select <image href="../media/image63.png" placement="break" height="19" width="31">
               <alt>placeholder</alt>
            </image>.</li>
         <li>To delete the previous character, select <image href="../media/image64.png" placement="break" height="17" width="21">
               <alt>placeholder</alt>
            </image>.</li>
      </ul>
  </context></taskbody>
</task>
